Proximity and Range
By SDragon42
ver $VERSION$    $MDK_DATE$
------------------------------------------------------------

Displays a "strait-line" proximity range from the ship to an obstacle.
Also supports a long range strait-line scan and will display basic information
on the target.
The configuration for the script is set in the "Custom Data" window.


The following commands can be used when running in partial/manual mode:

scan-range
    Performs a ray-cast scan on the tagged camera and display information on the target.

on
    Turns on the auto execution of the script.

off
    Turns off the auto-execution of the script.